{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは〜(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日人生初のサインをもらいましたᐠ( ˆ࿀ˆ )ᐟ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾜﾀﾅﾍﾞﾘｻから☆\nもなちゃんへって書いてもらった〜(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))\n嬉しい。ありがとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だに〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHA5XW07CHFG6TP8F7SHP8N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしてもダルメシアンの方がよくて何回もやり直した。!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前寝てて起きたとき髪の毛がわしゃーってなっててそれを誰かに見せたくで撮った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHA5YVCBT8ER68EK6P1SRJZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上の方がなんかパラダイス_( :⁍ 」 )_音楽聴きながら寝れるって幸せ〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタバの抹茶クリームフラペチーノのパウダー多めで豆乳で最近ずっと飲んでる。抹茶が濃くて美味しいの〜_( :⁍ 」 )_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"COCOちゃん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHA5ZXBFB9FY9NVVCGKH0PV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまらない。ぎゅーとわしゃーってしたいー。犬ってかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蚊取り線香の匂いって夏な感じがするねー!今年2番目に夏を感じる事ができた1番目は花火を見たこと!夏を感じれるって嬉しい。!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生の人は夏休みはもう少しで終わっちゃうのかな。私は課題ためて、最後の日に夜中までしてたな_( :⁍ 」 )_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHA60WEKSTQSJRQCS2XVA2M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったね〜(*^｡^*)"}],"source":"archive"}